    maxInterval: 12
    volume: 0.9
    volumeJitter: 0.3
    pitchJitter: 0.06
    maxAtOnce: 1
  notes: 'Lilymere restored: water lapping, drips, frogs and insects, birds. Reuses
    amb.pond until a Lilymere bed is made.'
